# DOT & DASH: the room gets busier as Dot gets richer. Once she has picked
# up 333 glints in all (or met the queen), red lancers with pea shooters
# appear in the room and the micro world; past 667, the queen's tin mice
# come out too, and fight the lancers where they meet.
game dotdash
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat nodash
cheat up tonic1
cheat area 0 30 82
wait 5
expect foes_1 == 0
expect foes_16 == 0
cheat glints 340
cheat area 0 30 82
wait 5
expect foes_1 >= 2
expect foes_16 == 0
cheat glints 700
cheat area 0 30 82
wait 5
expect foes_16 >= 2
# tin mice and lancers clash
cheat no_foes
cheat foe 16 200 654
cheat foe 1 212 656
wait 200
expect foes_1 == 0
